                    <adressee> Vuillelmo abbati</adressee> </pers_name>
                <place_name BNE="" BNE_city="" BNF="" BNF_city="" GND="" GND_city="" GS_Klosterdatenbank="" Getty="" LCCN="" LCCN_city="" VIAF="" VIAF_city="" addition="OCist; die Steine der Abtei wurden später für den Bau der Häuser in Les Chambons verwendet" category="Kloster" country="Frankreich" diocese="Vivarium" geo_DEZIMAL_city="" geo_DMS_city="N 45°06′00″ E 3°47′56″" geodata="N 44°37′43″ E 4°03′10″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="3031520" getty_city="" id="112470219" identification="Abbaye des Chambons" institution="Monasterium S. Mariae de Campis bonis" literature="" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{DA0A235D-FEC2-4885-823B-768FDA883A9C}">
                    <adressee> S. Mariae de Campis Bonis</adressee> </place_name>
                <pers_name BNF="" GND="" GermaniaSacra="" LCCN="" Wikidata="" addition="" floruit="" key="" life="" literature="" place="" reg="fratres S. Mariae de Campis Bonis" sex="" termofoffice="" uuid="">
                    <adressee> ejusque fratribus</adressee> </pers_name>: eorum postulationibus annuens, 
                <place_name BNE="" BNE_city="" BNF="" BNF_city="" GND="" GND_city="" GS_Klosterdatenbank="" Getty="" LCCN="" LCCN_city="" VIAF="" VIAF_city="" addition="OCist; die Steine der Abtei wurden später für den Bau der Häuser in Les Chambons verwendet" category="Kloster" country="Frankreich" diocese="Vivarium" geo_DEZIMAL_city="" geo_DMS_city="N 45°06′00″ E 3°47′56″" geodata="N 44°37′43″ E 4°03′10″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="3031520" getty_city="" id="112470219" identification="Abbaye des Chambons" institution="Monasterium S. Mariae de Campis bonis" literature="" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{DA0A235D-FEC2-4885-823B-768FDA883A9C}">B. Mariae monasterium</place_name> sub 
                <pers_name BNF="120020645" GND="118593323" LCCN=" n79022118" Wikidata="Q33923" floruit="33-64" key="54940864" life="gest. ca. 64" place="Roma" reg="s. Petrus apostolus" sex="male" uuid="{DBECC144-1D59-4673-AAA7-BC12BBCA6E84}">b. Petri</pers_name> et sua protectione suscipit communitque privilegio. Statuit de ordine monastico secundum 
                <pers_name addition="von Nursia" floruit="480-547" key="100179656" life="ca. 480-547" literature="PCBE 2/1, S. 285, Benedictus 3" place="Monte Cassino" reg="s. Benedictus abbas" sex="male" termofoffice="529-547" uuid="{294D6222-78C5-43E6-B90A-3994DF3B4D9F}">b. Benedicti</pers_name> regulam atque institutionem Cisterciensium observando. Confirmat possessiones propriis expressas vocabulis inter quas sunt 
                <place_name BNE="" BNE_city="" BNF="" BNF_city="" GND="" GND_city="" GS_Klosterdatenbank="" Getty="" LCCN="" LCCN_city="" VIAF="" VIAF_city="" addition="OCist; die Steine der Abtei wurden später für den Bau der Häuser in Les Chambons verwendet" category="Kloster" country="Frankreich" diocese="Vivarium" geo_DEZIMAL_city="" geo_DMS_city="N 45°06′00″ E 3°47′56″" geodata="N 44°37′43″ E 4°03′10″" geodata_region="0" geodata_vague="0" geonames_city="3031520" getty_city="" id="112470219" identification="Abbaye des Chambons" institution="Monasterium S. Mariae de Campis bonis" literature="" region="Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes" uuid="{DA0A235D-FEC2-4885-823B-768FDA883A9C}">abbatia de Campis Bonis</place_name>, 7 grangiae et 2 celleraria. Statuit de pace, tranquillitate et integritate eorum infra clausuram locorum seu grangiarum eorum. Concedit de clericis et laicis libere ad conversionem suscipiendis et retinendis; de professione stabilitateque fratrum; de decimis; de integritate monasterii; de terris seu beneficiis eorum non alienandis; inhibet ne monachus vel conversus pro aliquo fidejubeat vel ab aliquo mutuo pecuniam accipiat propter domus eorum utilitatem; statuit de testimonio fratrum in causis profanis; de convocatione ad synodos; de benedictione abbatis; de consecrationibus altarium vel ecclesiarum, de exemptione excommunicationis vel interdicti. Confirmat libertates sive a praedecessoribus suis sive a regibus et principibus concessas.</pont_reg_main>
